IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `types`

§ `Chapter 3 -- Punishments`

-- Penal Code 1871 ss 53, 54, 72, 73, 74, 74A, 74B, 74C, 74D, 74E.
-- Source: registers/source-bundle/PC1871.txt.
--
-- This module owns the punishment vocabulary used by every offence module.
-- A `Punishment` is the ceiling (and, where the Code fixes one, the floor) that a
-- section prescribes. It is not a sentence: it is what the section makes available.

§§ `Section 53 -- The punishments available under this Code`

-- 53(a) death; (b) imprisonment; (c) forfeiture of property; (d) fine; (e) caning.
-- Explanation: caning shall be with a rattan.

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 53"
DECLARE `Punishment Kind` IS ONE OF
    `death`
    `imprisonment`
    `forfeiture of property`
    `fine`
    `caning`

§§ `The punishment record`

-- `maximum imprisonment in years` is 0 where no imprisonment is prescribed, and is
-- disregarded where `imprisonment for life is available` or `death is mandatory`.
-- s 54: "imprisonment for life" means imprisonment for the duration of a natural
-- life, so it is a distinct flag rather than a number of years.
-- `maximum fine in dollars` is 0 where the Code says "with fine" without a figure.

@ref "Penal Code 1871, ss 53 and 54"
DECLARE Punishment HAS
    `death is available` IS A BOOLEAN
    `death is mandatory` IS A BOOLEAN
    `imprisonment for life is available` IS A BOOLEAN
    `maximum imprisonment in years` IS A NUMBER
    `minimum imprisonment in years` IS A NUMBER
    `fine is available` IS A BOOLEAN
    `maximum fine in dollars` IS A NUMBER
    `caning is available` IS A BOOLEAN
    `minimum strokes of caning` IS A NUMBER
    `forfeiture of property is available` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Constructors`

-- Compact builders so each offence section can state its punishment on one line.

`no punishment prescribed` MEANS Punishment WITH
    `death is available` IS FALSE
    `death is mandatory` IS FALSE
    `imprisonment for life is available` IS FALSE
    `maximum imprisonment in years` IS 0
    `minimum imprisonment in years` IS 0
    `fine is available` IS FALSE
    `maximum fine in dollars` IS 0
    `caning is available` IS FALSE
    `minimum strokes of caning` IS 0
    `forfeiture of property is available` IS FALSE

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Punishment
`imprisonment up to` y MEANS Punishment WITH
    `death is available` IS FALSE
    `death is mandatory` IS FALSE
    `imprisonment for life is available` IS FALSE
    `maximum imprisonment in years` IS y
    `minimum imprisonment in years` IS 0
    `fine is available` IS FALSE
    `maximum fine in dollars` IS 0
    `caning is available` IS FALSE
    `minimum strokes of caning` IS 0
    `forfeiture of property is available` IS FALSE

